@startuml
actor Candidate
participant FE
participant AISvc
database DB


Candidate -> FE : Mở "Gợi ý dành cho bạn"
FE -> AISvc : getSuggestions(userId)
AISvc -> DB : read user signals (search/view/save/apply)
AISvc -> DB : get jobs/features
AISvc -> AISvc : recommend()
AISvc --> FE : suggestions
FE --> Candidate : Render danh sách gợi ý
@enduml